<title>USA: Apple Orthodontix to offer class A shares.</title>
<headline>Apple Orthodontix to offer class A shares.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Orthodontix Inc said Wednesday it that it has filed with the United States Securities and Exchange Commission a Registration Statement covering 2 million shares of Apple Orthodontix Class A Common Stock.  The company said it plans to use the shares in connection with affiliations with orthodontic practices and other related transactions.</p>
</text>
